# Testing

## Commands (from repo root)

```sh
go test p4wn/...
go test p4wn/internal/content -run TestGolden -update
go test p4wn/internal/pdf -fuzz FuzzOpen
go test p4wn/internal/filter -fuzz FuzzDecode
```

## Goldens

- Live in `testdata/golden/`; inputs in `testdata/pdfs/`
- Failing goldens mean investigate render output—do not “fix” by rewriting
  unless the new pixels/HTML are verified correct
- Use `-update` only when intentionally accepting a new baseline
- Prefer adding a fixture PDF over one-off local-only test files

## Fuzz

- Touching `pdf` parsers/xref/decrypt → consider `FuzzOpen`
- Touching `filter` decoders/predictors → consider `FuzzDecode`

## Fixtures

- Generators: `testtools/genimg`, `gentext`, `genjp`
- Keep fixtures small and purposeful
- Do not commit runtime output from `data/`
